{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 140,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, A Psalm of David. Deliver me, O LORD, from the evil man: preserve me from the violent man;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who imagine mischiefs in ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " heart; continually are they assembled ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " war.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have sharpened their tongues like a serpent; adder's poison ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " under their lips. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep me, O LORD, from the hands of the wicked; preserve me from the violent man; who have purposed to overthrow my goings.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The proud have hid a snare for me, and cords; they have spread a net by the way side: they have set gins for me. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I said to the LORD, Thou ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " my God: hear the voice of my supplications, O LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O GOD the Lord, the strength of my salvation, thou hast covered my head in the day of battle.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Grant not, O LORD, the desires of the wicked: further not his wicked device; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "lest",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they exalt themselves. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the head of those that encompass me, let the mischief of their own lips cover them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let burning coals fall upon them: let them be cast into the fire; into deep pits, that they rise not again.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Let not an evil speaker be established on the earth: evil shall hunt the violent man to overthrow ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I know that the LORD will maintain the cause of the afflicted, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the right of the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.140.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.140.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Surely the righteous shall give thanks to thy name: the upright shall dwell in thy presence.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
